H: HEAL accounts for 23% of all jobs versus only 7% for STEM
T: Discrimination of opportunities
C: United States
D: 2022
O: Richard V. Reeves, Of Boys and Men
B: HEAL occupations make up about 23% of all jobs while STEM accounts for only about 7%, and for every STEM job created by 2030 an estimated three HEAL jobs will be created, making the female-dominated HEAL sector a huge untapped opportunity for men.
